    "description": "To honour the volunteer members of Aga Khan University Hospitality Committee, President Shamsh Kassim-Lakha and Khadijah Lakha organized a dinner on Tuesday August 19, 2003 in the serene environment of AKU Sports and Rehabilitation Centre.",
